        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nAt first glance it seems like some misconfiguration issue, but I'll look into it.\r\n\r\n> Ideally, it would be great to have a way to disable / blacklist for various filetypes that commonly have trailing whitespace.\r\n\r\n> Buftype blacklist would also be great :)\r\n\r\nPrecisely because of such various use cases there won't be dedicated blocklists for filetype-buftype-etc. See [disabling](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/fd5d244647cf1f37e85ba3e490d5968df33ef430/doc/mini-trailspace.txt#L35-L43) section in help file.",
            "created_at": "2023-12-29T09:31:17Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/631#issuecomment-1871875218",
            "id": 1871875218,
            "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/631",
