        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Here 'mini.trailspace' works as expected.\r\n\r\nThe 'dashboard-nvim' uses normal buffer to display its content (see [here](https://github.com/nvimdev/dashboard-nvim/issues/409)).\r\n\r\nYou can disable for `'dashboard'` filetype like this (autocommand should be done *before* dashboard creates its buffer):\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.cmd('au FileType dashboard lua vim.b.minitrailspace_disable = true')\r\nrequire('dashboard').setup()\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2023-12-29T09:42:49Z",
